{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995650/extras/2e1dc8ff8a5cab0044053509b5c6415c.poster.avif?t=1760095167\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995650/extras/2e1dc8ff8a5cab0044053509b5c6415c.webm?t=1760095167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995650/extras/2e1dc8ff8a5cab0044053509b5c6415c.mp4?t=1760095167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a dad, you\u2019re expected to handle life\u2019s unexpected challenges. You\u2019ve just run out of milk\u2026 so it\u2019s time to step up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or more precisely, <strong>grapple your way up the impossible tower to bring home that milk.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Milk Run</strong>, you play as a loveably tipsy but well-meaning father, armed with nothing but a grappling hook and stubborn dad energy. Swing, climb, and stumble your way through a physics-driven nightmare of balconies, signs, and comically random hazards to secure that precious carton.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995650/extras/d86ff64a28fedd15d830289293742904.poster.avif?t=1760095167\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995650/extras/d86ff64a28fedd15d830289293742904.webm?t=1760095167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995650/extras/d86ff64a28fedd15d830289293742904.mp4?t=1760095167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics Comedy</strong> \u2013 Every swing and slip is a gamble. Master the grappling hook or face hilarious failure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Long Climb</strong> \u2013 An absurd vertical world filled with awkward obstacles, tricky momentum, and unexpected shortcuts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Solo or With Friends</strong> \u2013 Many hands make light work\u2026 but when each player controls a different limb, chaos is guarante</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995650/extras/bf49d1fb7eee415df4b812952e2b2503.poster.avif?t=1760095167\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995650/extras/bf49d1fb7eee415df4b812952e2b2503.webm?t=1760095167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995650/extras/bf49d1fb7eee415df4b812952e2b2503.mp4?t=1760095167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Question</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life isn\u2019t easy. Neither is climbing for milk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you finally hold it in your hands, you\u2019ll have to ask yourself:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you return home\u2026 or call it a job well done?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3995650?t=1760095167","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3995650?t=1760095167","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995650/3a7143a728be6ac4bddf2610e57517591e3bc09e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760095167","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.ak